://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-dff127de3093215d1c16f610b11d9e37_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"495\" height=\"527\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":363,"commentCount":160,"created":1655687350,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1522143751421603840"},{"id":"1521570634152423424","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-1770a651b8d70cf4ea0f4a1f7204a858_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1502\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":164,"commentCount":29,"created":1655550708,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1521570634152423424"},{"id":"1521489405805617152","title":"我以前在国内大学的时候，学校给的招聘信…","content":"<p>我以前在国内大学的时候，学校给的招聘信息就特别离谱。&lt;br&gt;最好的招聘信息优先给学生会干部，即使他们都挂科无数了，然后把干部挑剩下的信息再放到就业大群里，或者就直接不放。&lt;br&gt;这可能就是近水楼台先得月吧。</p>","excerpt":"我以前在国内大学的时候，学校给的招聘信…","voteupCount":127,"commentCount":14,"created":1655531342,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1521489405805617152"},{"id":"1521098787216523264","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-059f729fb1320a12fdefacc53b40c4db_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"361\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":93,"commentCount":10,"created":1655438211,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1521098787216523264"},{"id":"1520547840115482624","title":"兄弟们来帮我的朋友 @江睿谨 点波关注吧…","content":"<p>兄弟们来帮我的朋友 &lt;a data-hash=&quot;b2d1573077a268d6724dccf6f6ba92bb&quot; href=&quot;https://www.zhihu.com/people/b2d1573077a268d6724dccf6f6ba92bb&quot; class=&quot;member_mention&quot; data-hovercard=&quot;p$b$b2d1573077a268d6724dccf6f6ba92bb&quot;&gt;@江睿谨 &lt;/a&gt;点波关注吧。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;顺带我在鼓掌里抽个奖，这两天行情不错，还是一百现金，鼓掌即可。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;感谢大家一直以来的支持。</p>","excerpt":"兄弟们来帮我的朋友 @江睿谨 点波关注吧…","voteupCount":206,"commentCount":3,"created":1655306855,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1520547840115482624"}]}